### ========== 超级管理用户登录，获取token ==========
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openid": "openid_001"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}


### ========== 管理员登录，获取token ==========
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openid": "openid_004"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}


### ========== ApplicationController 接口调试 ==========

### 查询本人提交的申请记录 (Pass)
GET {{baseURL}}/application/my-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查询本人提交的申请记录（指定类型） (Pass)
GET {{baseURL}}/application/my-applications?applicationType=CREATE_ORG
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查询所有申请（管理用） (Pass)
GET {{baseURL}}/application/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查询所有申请（按类型/状态过滤）(Pass)
GET {{baseURL}}/application/list?applicationType=JOIN_ORG&status=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 批量审核申请 (Pass)
POST {{baseURL}}/application/batch-review
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

[
  {
    "applicationId": 11,
    "newStatus": 2,
    "reason": "拒绝理由"
  }
]

### 撤销个人申请 (Pass)
POST {{baseURL}}/application/revoke?applicationId=6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========== OrganizationController 组织相关接口调试 ==========
### 提交创建组织申请（form-data: Json+文件二选一） (Pass)
POST {{baseURL}}/organization/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary
Accept: application/json

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="body"
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{"orgName":"极客社222","orgDescription":"技术极客聚集地","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1?v=4"}
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatarFile"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

--WebAppBoundary--

### 更换组织首领 （Pass）
POST {{baseURL}}/organization/change-leader?orgId=4&newLeaderId=4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取所有组织 (Pass)
GET {{baseURL}}/organization/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取指定组织详情 (Pass)
GET {{baseURL}}/organization/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 提交组织解散申请 （Pass）
POST {{baseURL}}/organization/disband?orgId=4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取某个组织成员列表 (Pass)
GET {{baseURL}}/organization/3/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取自己加入的组织列表 (Pass)
GET {{baseURL}}/organization/my-organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========== 组织成员相关接口 ==========

### 申请加入组织（JSON DTO）(Pass)
POST {{baseURL}}/organization/member/apply
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "orgId": 3,
  "reason": "我热爱组织，想一起成长"
}

### 更改组织成员身份（JSON DTO）(Pass)
POST {{baseURL}}/organization/member/change-role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "orgId": 3,
  "memberId": 5,
  "newRole": "MANAGER"
}

### 退出组织 (Pass)
POST {{baseURL}}/organization/member/quit?orgId=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 踢出组织成员 (Pass)
POST {{baseURL}}/organization/member/kick?orgId=3&memberId=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========== 组织相册相关接口 ==========

### 上传组织相册图片（form-data: Json+文件二选一）(Pass)
POST {{baseURL}}/organization/album/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="body"
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{"organizationId":3,"photoUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1?v=4"}
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photoFile"; filename="avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

--WebAppBoundary--

### 删除组织相册图片 (Pass)
POST {{baseURL}}/organization/album/delete?photoId=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查询组织相册图片列表 (Pass)
POST {{baseURL}}/organization/album/list?organizationId=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== 其他接口调试 ==========
GET http://localhost:8080/data/org-avatar/monalisa-200x200.jpg
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}